aborating with professional filmmakers, we\u2019ve captured each moment with stunning visuals that bring their world to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Heroines, Four Irresistible Charms</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet four unique heroines, each with their own personality and irresistible appeal. Whether it's the fiery tsundere, the mischievous troublemaker, the mature beauty, or the girl-next-door type. They won\u2019t make it easy for you, and that's exactly why you\u2019ll want to keep playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, who will you manage to win over in the end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Us</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re Storytaco, an interactive game developer. We\u2019re excited to greet the Steam community once again with our latest FMV game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ll keep creating games that spark your imagination and keep you entertained. So enjoy every moment with the heroines who love to tease you nonstop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you, as always, for your valuable feedback and ongoing support. We will keep working hard to deliver even better games for you in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Stay Updated \u25c6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25ba Discord: BeautiyGirls Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25ba Instagram: @beautygirls_story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25ba YouTube: @beautygirls_story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25ba Customer Support: <a href=\"mailto:cs@storytaco.com\">cs@storytaco.com</a></p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Get out!!!&quot; Kicked out in the dead of winter, you land a job at a shady hotel. But work\u2019s not the only challenge, there\u2019s the CEO\u2019s cold-hearted granddaughter, a lazy senior, a diva model, and your childhood friend who makes you do her laundry?! Who will you charm in this chaotic love game?",
